    "label": "theorem: group-regret",
    "number": "Theorem 1",
    "quote": "Under Assumptions 1 and 2, the group regret of QuACK run with single-player bandit algorithm $\\pi$ and leading agent $v \\in V$ is bounded by R_{G}(n) \\leq S_{\\pi}(mn) + (3 \\cdot \\sum_{w = 1}^{m}d_{vw})\\sum_{a = 1}^{k} \\Delta_{a}."
   },
   "confidence": "medium",
   "notes": "Group regret (sum over m agents, here N) defined through gaps times expected pulls: pseudo-regret. Black-box reduction; horizon requirements inherited from pi."
